interval:
The idea of a knife cuts real flesh;
And still, devouring the safe interval
Which Nature placed between the thought and act,

interrupts:
And so I answered. Till Lord Howe broke in;
‘What penance takes the wretch who interrupts
The talk of charming women? I, at last,

intertwined:
My God is dark--like woven texture flowing,
A hundred drinking roots, all intertwined;
I only know that from His warmth I'm growing.

intricacies:
Go carving dexterous avenues
Through sly intricacies;
Ten thousand years on jungle clues

intimidated:
As from the specter of pursuing death;
Intimidated lest thy mighty breath,
Windways, will sweep me into utter night.

intenser:
So that you can make anew,
Fusing with intenser fire,
Something nearer your desire;

intermit:
I feel as if the grass were pleased
To have it intermit;
The surreptitious scion

intimates:
Not any voice denotes it here,
Or intimates it there;
A spirit, how doth it accost?
